{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d00000003","type":"group","x":120,"y":0,"width":500,"height":1940,"color":"4","label":"2 · Domaenen-Modell (Entities & @dataclasses)"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d00000004","type":"group","x":1210,"y":-90,"width":500,"height":1780,"color":"2","label":"3 · Assembly & Business-Logik"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d00000001","type":"group","x":-240,"y":-1120,"width":1450,"height":600,"color":"3","label":"0 · Orchestrierung / Composition Root"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d00000002","type":"group","x":-800,"y":0,"width":500,"height":760,"color":"5","label":"1 · Eingabe (I/O-Schicht)"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d00000005","type":"group","x":2120,"y":0,"width":500,"height":520,"color":"5","label":"4 · Ausgabe (I/O-Schicht)"},
		{"id":"100000000000000d","type":"text","text":"## «interface» `RecommendationWriter`\n*Abstraktion (Protocol/ABC)*\n\n+ `write(recs, path) -> None`\n\n**Open/Closed:** `JsonRecommendationWriter` o.ä.\nließe sich ergänzen, ohne die App zu ändern.","x":2160,"y":40,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"100000000000000e","type":"text","text":"## `CsvRecommendationWriter`  ⟶ implements\n*I/O-Concern: nur Schreiben, keine Preislogik*\n\nSchreibt die `PriceRecommendation`-Objekte mit\ndem `csv`-Modul in eine **neue** CSV-Datei.","x":2160,"y":310,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## `PriceableUnitBuilder`\n*SRP: setzt aus Rohdaten Domänen-Objekte zusammen\n(entspricht deinem `_build_capacity`)*\n\n+ `build(capacity_rows, bookings) -> list[PriceableUnit]`\n\n- expandiert jede `Booking` in belegte Nächte\n- aggregiert `booked_units` je (product_id, date)\n- mischt sie in die Kapazitätszeilen","x":1250,"y":-50,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## `PricingApp` · Orchestrierung\n*Dependency Injection (Constructor)*\n\n**Attribute (injiziert, nur Interfaces):**\n- source: `DataSource`\n- builder: `PriceableUnitBuilder`\n- engine: `RecommendationEngine`\n- writer: `RecommendationWriter`\n\n**Methoden (= die 2 geforderten Funktionen):**\n+ `calculate_all_price_recommendations(out_path)`\n+ `get_max_recommendation() -> PriceRecommendation | None`\n\nKennt keine I/O-Details → lose Kopplung, testbar","x":770,"y":-1080,"width":420,"height":520,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## `main()` · Entry Point\n*Composition Root – hier wird verdrahtet*\n\nErzeugt die **konkreten** Implementierungen und injiziert sie in `PricingApp`:\n- `CsvDataSource`\n- `PriceableUnitBuilder`\n- `RecommendationEngine(HeuristicStrategy())`\n- `CsvRecommendationWriter`\n\nRuft auf:\n- `app.calculate_all_price_recommendations()`\n- `app.get_max_recommendation()`","x":-160,"y":-1080,"width":420,"height":460,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"100000000000000f","type":"text","text":"## Bewusste Entscheidungen (nicht übertreiben)\n\n- **Keine** `PriceableUnit`-Subklassen (`DigitalProduct` …):\n  die Daten kennen nur EINE Art buchbarer Einheit.\n  Eine Klassenhierarchie wäre *Speculative Generality*.\n- Polymorphie nur dort, wo sie echten Nutzen bringt:\n  **Strategy** (Formel) & **Writer** (Ausgabeformat).\n- Genutzte Konzepte: SoC/SRP, Kapselung, Abstraktion,\n  Interfaces (ABC/Protocol), Dependency Injection,\n  Open/Closed, Polymorphie, Dataclasses & dunder.\n- `prices.csv` bleibt bewusst simpel: für die 2 Funktionen\n  reicht Kapazität/Auslastung. `Price` ist als optionaler\n  Kontext fürs Ergebnis-Objekt vorgesehen (kann in v1 auch\n  ganz weggelassen werden).","x":2000,"y":-1240,"width":420,"height":680,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1000000000000010","type":"text","text":"## Datenfluss (Lesehilfe)\n\n`main()` verdrahtet alles und ruft `PricingApp` auf.\n\n1. **`DataSource`** liest die CSVs → `Booking` / `Price` / Kapazität\n2. **`PriceableUnitBuilder`** baut daraus `PriceableUnit`-Objekte\n3. **`RecommendationEngine`** wendet die **`Strategy`** an\n   → `list[PriceRecommendation]`\n4. **`RecommendationWriter`** schreibt sie in eine neue CSV\n5. `get_max` gibt die stärkste Empfehlung ins Terminal aus\n\nJede Schicht kennt nur die *Schnittstelle* der nächsten,\nnicht deren konkrete Implementierung.","x":-1090,"y":-1040,"width":540,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## «interface» `DataSource`\n*Abstraktion – ABC oder `typing.Protocol`*\n\n+ `load_capacity() -> list[CapacityRow]`\n+ `load_bookings() -> list[Booking]`\n+ `load_prices() -> list[Price]`\n\n**Warum Interface?** Open/Closed – eine spätere\n`JsonDataSource` braucht keine App-Änderung.","x":-760,"y":40,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"1000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## `CsvDataSource`  ⟶ implements `DataSource`\n*I/O-Concern: nur Einlesen, keine Fachlogik*\n\n- `data_dir: Path`\n\nLiest die 3 CSVs mit dem `csv`-Modul und gibt\nreine Domänen-Objekte zurück (`Booking`, `Price`, …).","x":-760,"y":400,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"100000000000000b","type":"text","text":"## `HeuristicRecommendationStrategy`\n⟶ implements `RecommendationStrategy`\n\nDie Formel aus der Aufgabe:\n**15 % · (a − 0.5) · (0.5 + d)**\n a = `unit.occupancy`\n d = `days_until_travel / 300`","x":1250,"y":1440,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"100000000000000a","type":"text","text":"## «interface» `RecommendationStrategy`\n*Abstraktion – `ABC` mit `@abstractmethod`*\n\n+ `calculate(unit: PriceableUnit,\n            reference_date) -> Decimal`\n\n**Polymorphie + Open/Closed:** Berechnungs-Formel\naustauschbar, ohne die Engine anzufassen.","x":1250,"y":1012,"width":420,"height":278,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"100000000000000c","type":"text","text":"## `RecommendationEngine`\n*Business-Logik, **kein** I/O – isoliert testbar*\n\n**Attribute (injiziert):**\n- `strategy: RecommendationStrategy`\n- `reference_date: date`  (`@property`, Default = heute)\n\n**Methoden:**\n+ `calculate_all(units) -> list[PriceRecommendation]`\n   – filtert Zukunft, überspringt total_capacity == 0\n     bzw. negative Kapazität\n+ `get_max(recs) -> PriceRecommendation | None`\n   – nutzt `max(recs)` (dank `__lt__`)","x":1250,"y":405,"width":420,"height":520,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## `PriceableUnit` · Entity (Kernobjekt)\n*Kapselung + Abstraktion – das Objekt \"weiß\" selbst,\nwie ausgelastet es ist*\n\n**Attribute:**\n- `product_id: str`\n- `calendar_date: date`\n- `_booked_units`, `_bookable_units`, `_optional_units: int`\n  → im `__init__` validiert (keine unsinnigen Werte)\n\n**berechnete Properties (read-only):**\n+ `total_capacity: int`   `@property`\n+ `occupancy: float`      `@property`  (booked / total)\n\n**Methoden:**\n+ `days_until_travel(reference_date) -> int`","x":160,"y":40,"width":420,"height":620,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1000000000000009","type":"text","text":"## `PriceRecommendation` · `@dataclass(order=True)`\n*Ergebnis-Objekt – Rückgabe von `get_max_recommendation()`*\n\n- `product_id`, `calendar_date`\n- `days_until_travel: int`\n- `recommended_adjustment_pct: Decimal`  ← Sortierschlüssel\n- `occupancy: float`\n- `total_capacity`, `booked_units: int`\n\n`order=True` erzeugt `__lt__` → `max(recs)` liefert direkt\ndie höchste Anpassung (dunder-Nutzen).","x":160,"y":1480,"width":420,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1000000000000008","type":"text","text":"## `Price` · `@dataclass(frozen=True)`\n*unveränderlicher Datencontainer*\n\n- `product_id: str`\n- `change_date: date`\n- `length_of_stay: str`\n- `price_sterling: Decimal`\n\n`frozen=True` → nach Erzeugung garantiert konstant.","x":160,"y":1140,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1000000000000007","type":"text","text":"## `Booking` · `@dataclass`\n*Datencontainer – `__init__/__repr__/__eq__` autogeneriert*\n\n- `product_id: str`\n- `start_date: date`\n- `nights: int`\n- `status: str`\n\n+ `is_firm: bool`               `@property`\n+ `occupied_nights() -> list[date]`\n   (D, D+1, … D+nights−1 – Checkout-Tag zählt nicht)","x":160,"y":695,"width":420,"height":405,"color":"4"}
	],
